<section id="engineering" class="section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="engineering-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="badge-orange" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; background: rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.08); border-color: rgba(255, 77, 0, 0.25);">
          METALLURGY & QUALITY STANDARDS
        </div>
        <h2 class="heading-display" style="color: var(--color-text-dark-primary); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          10,000 TONS OF PRESSURE. ZERO COMPROMISE.
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-dark-secondary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Cast wheels crack under radial fatigue. Flow-formed wheels deform under curb strikes. AGNI monoblock wheels are compressed under a continuous 10,000-ton hydraulic forging press, aligning the aluminum grain structure along the directional flow of each spoke.
        </p>

        <table class="spec-sheet-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>MATERIAL BASE</td>
              <td>AEROSPACE 6061-T6 ALUMINUM BILLET</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>TENSILE YIELD STRENGTH</td>
              <td>310 MPA (MINIMUM SPEC)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>UNSPRUNG MASS REDUCTION</td>
              <td>-28% TO -35% VS OEM CAST WHEELS</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>BEAD SEAT SPECIFICATION</td>
              <td>KNURLED ANTI-SLIP TRACK APPLICATION</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>TESTING CERTIFICATIONS</td>
              <td>TÜV RHEINLAND / JWL / VIA / SAE J2530</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>ROTATIONAL BALANCE TOLERANCE</td>
              <td>< 0.15 MM RADIAL RUNOUT GUARANTEED</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--color-light-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-light-border); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000;">FEA STRESS DEFORMATION MAP</div>
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: #888;">FINITE ELEMENT ANALYSIS RUN #992-AF01</div>
          </div>
          <span class="badge-verified">PASS • 1,200 KG CORNER LOAD</span>
        </div>

        <div style="aspect-ratio: 16/10; background: #0c0d10; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160607-ee22621dd758?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="CNC 5-Axis Milling Spoke Machining Process" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.85;" />
          <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: #fff;">
            5-AXIS CNC POCKETING • BACK-PAD CHAMFERING
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-dark-secondary); line-height: 1.5;">
          Every wheel undergoes ultrasonic grain inspection, coordinate measuring machine (CMM) dimensional verification, and dynamic cornering fatigue tests before packaging.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Engineering Specs",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}

